<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.semantic-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T37>
  谁负责从普通自然语言决定 workflow warrant、form、topology、starting fact 和工具调用？
  </?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T37>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T38>
    由 AI Workflow 专属系统级 Skill 指导大模型处理，坚决禁止代码中的模糊匹配。
    </?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T38>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T39>
    专属 workflow actor 是自然语言 semantic authority；deterministic code 只验证和执行显式结构化命令。
    </?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T39>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T3A>
    模型擅长开放语义，组件擅长可验证 transition；混淆两者会产生脆弱 heuristic 和错误 route。
    </?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T3A>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T3B>
    用户明确约束；既有 actor-boundary durable decision；事故 session 的错误 composite route。
    </?01KZKTFNTXTTXG1W6TSXVK0T3B>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.global-location apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSA>
  AI Workflow 提示词的产品真源安装在哪里？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSA>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSB>
    通过 eidolon global init 初始化或替换 global 目录（默认 ~/.eidolon）下的系统级 Skills。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSB>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSC>
    `eidolon global init` SHALL reconcile the product-bundled system-skill set and install the canonical AI Workflow Skill at `<global-eidolon-dir>/skills/sys-ai-workflow`。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSC>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSD>
    该能力属于 Eidolon 产品而非某个 workspace，必须跨项目稳定存在。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSD>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSE>
    用户明确指定的 global Skill 位置。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSE>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.stage-boundary apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSF>
  编辑与运行应如何呈现为产品交互？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSF>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSG>
    参考 KWF 分离编辑和运行两个产品交互阶段。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSG>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSH>
    同一系统 Skill 明确区分 authoring/edit stage 与 prepare/run stage；publication 与 execution 分别作为独立 gate。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSH>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSJ>
    编辑改变 definition，运行消费 immutable published revision，两者的事实、工具和授权不同。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSJ>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSK>
    用户要求；现有 publication/execution lifecycle contract。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSK>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.prompt-layering apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSM>
  系统 Skill 的提示词和知识应按什么生命周期组织？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSM>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSN>
    眼光放到完整 DevOps 生命周期；先按阶段创建父目录，flow-dsl 只在 coding 下按原结构组织，其它提示词也归入对应阶段。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSN>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSP>
    `SKILL.md` SHALL route the DevOps lifecycle stages `planning/coding/building/testing/releasing/deploying/operating/monitoring`; every stage SHALL own its system prompt and protocol, and only `coding` SHALL carry the load-bearing generation kernel and flow-dsl tree。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSP>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSQ>
    粗粒度 authoring/run 不能表达规划、构建、验证、发布、部署、运维、观测的不同事实、工具和提示词；按生命周期分层同时支持渐进披露。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSQ>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSR>
    用户明确修正；KWF 分层 prompt/generation-kernel 证据；AI Workflow 产品 transition。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSR>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.flow-dsl-skeleton apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSS>
  depa-flows flow-dsl 应怎样内嵌到 AI Workflow Skill？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSS>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KST>
    保留骨架，裁剪用不到的地方，再补充 AI Workflow 特有内容。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KST>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSV>
    The installed Skill SHALL preserve the upstream `foundation/std/spec` hierarchy under `coding/flow-dsl`, embedding a provenance-tracked L1 foundation → EagerDataFlow/WorkCtrlFlow substrate → AI workflow profile skeleton while trimming only irrelevant product details。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSV>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSW>
    AI profile 的正确语义依赖 substrate 与基础公理；只复制几个示例会诱发臆造语法和事实源混淆。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSW>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSX>
    depa-flows flow-dsl README、foundation、flow-core、eager/work substrate、AI profile specs and axioms。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSX>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.global-init apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSY>
  未来多个系统级 Skill 应如何安装和升级？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSY>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSZ>
    统一通过 `eidolon global init` 初始化或者替换 `~/.eidolon/skills/` 中的系统级 Skill。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KSZ>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT0>
    `eidolon global init` SHALL stage, validate and atomically replace every product-managed `sys-*` Skill listed in `.system-skills.xnl`, preserve unmanaged user skills, and support adding system Skills in future releases without new installation commands。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT0>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT1>
    系统能力需要一个可重复、可审计、可扩展的产品安装入口；直接覆盖整个 skills 目录会破坏用户资产。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT1>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT2>
    用户明确指定 global init；global skills 目录同时可能存在用户 Skill。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT2>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.system-identity apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT3>
  workspace 中的同名 skill 是否可以覆盖产品系统 Skill？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT3>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT4>
    提示词应存放在 global 目录，作为产品专属系统级 skill。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT4>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT5>
    `sys-ai-workflow` SHALL be a global-only reserved identity; workspace skills MUST NOT shadow it, and missing or incompatible global installations SHALL fail explicitly。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT5>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT6>
    若 workspace 可覆盖，产品语义、安全门和跨入口一致性就不再由产品拥有。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT6>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT7>
    用户指定 global path；现有 workspace-only Skill loader 与多根覆盖机制。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT7>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.establish-system-ai-workflow-skill.fact-ownership apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT8>
  编辑、发布和运行各自消费与产生什么事实？
  </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT8>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT9>
    编辑和运行是不同产品交互，确定性代码只执行结构化 transition。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KT9>
    <decision-text ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KTA>
    Definition workspace revision, fresh validation proof, immutable publication, input/material binding, WorkCtrlFlow snapshot and AIDataWorkflow RunGraph SHALL remain distinct facts with distinct owners and authorization transitions。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KTA>
    <rationale ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KTB>
    把运行 patch、snapshot 或 confirmation 回写 definition 会制造第二真源并破坏恢复等价性。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KTB>
    <evidence ?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KTC>
    KWF workflow-authoring lifecycle；depa-flows flow-core/work/AI workflow fact-owner specifications。
    </?01KZKTFNTYEV0NHYVCGK081KTC>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.failure-terminal apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPE>
  Provider completion 失败时 delegate 应以何种终态返回？
  </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPE>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPF>
    失败必须失败，不能 completed 后返回空字符串。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPF>
    <decision-text ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPG>
    Provider failure SHALL terminate the delegate and parent workflow tool as structured failure。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPG>
    <rationale ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPH>
    terminal state 是控制面 authority，不能与 effect evidence 矛盾。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPH>
    <evidence ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPJ>
    事故 session 与 AiAgentExecutor provider_failed 分支。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPJ>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.result-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPK>
