    <rationale ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPP>
    避免不同 driver 分支读取不同事实源并产生空结果。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPP>
    <evidence ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPQ>
    DelegateActor 注释与 driverRuntime 当前实现冲突。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPQ>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.tool-call-identity apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPR>
  并行 tool-call identity 缺失或冲突时是否允许猜测合并？
  </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPR>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPS>
