<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.stage-outcome apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPX>
  怎样防止 workflow actor 在没有产物时持续探索十余分钟？
  </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPX>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPY>
    按 KWF 的有限产品阶段，每轮必须有结构化进展，修复循环和 provider retry 都受产品 deadline 约束。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPY>
    <decision-text ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPZ>
    Every workflow actor turn SHALL produce a non-empty structured stage outcome or native tool effect; proof repair SHALL be bounded and the product stage deadline SHALL cap provider retries。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFPZ>
    <rationale ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFQ0>
    provider timeout 不是用户旅程预算；只有可观测 transition 才能证明产品在前进。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFQ0>
    <evidence ?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFQ1>
    事故 session 十一分钟无 workspace mutation；KWF structured scaffold/infer and bounded model E2E。
    </?01KZKWFSP4D00WZ11ERKNZWFQ1>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.fix-workflow-fulfill-terminal-and-continuation.failure-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A18>
  Provider failure 之前已有 partial assistant content 时谁拥有终态？
  </?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A18>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A19>
    当前 provider failure 必须覆盖旧 partial content。
    </?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A19>
    <decision-text ?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A1A>
    Provider terminal failure SHALL fail the actor; prior Conversation Domain output MAY be retained as evidence but MUST NOT reclassify the terminal state。
    </?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A1A>
    <rationale ?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A1B>
    effect terminal 是当前控制事实，历史消息只是记录。
    </?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A1B>
    <evidence ?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A1C>
    真实回归 sequence 68/170。
    </?01KZM376J89SBRFRM2JQJ91A1C>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>

<decision #track.fix-workflow-fulfill-terminal-and-continuation.sync-wait-single-writer apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01KZM376J9DYZVC71NQQ8D51YF>
